# Dashboards & charts

- Use **recharts** for all charts and graphs (Line, Bar, Area, Pie, etc.).
- Chart UI lives in `components/` (≤ 100 lines each); pages only import those chart components.
- Data for charts comes from `data/` via the page, passed as props — charts do not fetch.

```tsx
// ✅
import { EnrollmentChart } from "@/components/dashboard/enrollment-chart";
import { getEnrollmentStats } from "@/data/dashboard";

const stats = await getEnrollmentStats();
return <EnrollmentChart data={stats} />;
```
